[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5592839033","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123318#issuecomment-5592839033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123318","id":5592839033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTVvzeQ","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-08T22:38:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T22:38:28Z","body":"Per my reading of [the docs](https://developer.android.com/reference/java/lang/Class#getDeclaredFields()), the difference between `Class.getFields()` and `Class.getDeclaredFields()`, is that `Class.getFields()` is limited to public fields and `Class.getDeclaredFields()` will return all fields (including private and protected ones).\r\n\r\nWhy do we need to switch to `Class.getDeclaredFields()`? I would have assumed that exposing only public fields is what we want?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5592839033/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5592930508","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123318#issuecomment-5592930508","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123318","id":5592930508,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTV1YzA","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-08T22:47:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T22:47:13Z","body":"> Per my reading of [the docs](https://developer.android.com/reference/java/lang/Class#getDeclaredFields()), the difference between `Class.getFields()` and `Class.getDeclaredFields()`, is that `Class.getFields()` is limited to public fields and `Class.getDeclaredFields()` will return all fields (including private and protected ones).\r\n> \r\n> Why do we need to switch to `Class.getDeclaredFields()`? I would have assumed that exposing only public fields is what we want?\r\n\r\n`Class.getFields()` includes all public fields including inherited ones, whereas `Class.getDeclaredFields()` includes fields of all visibility scope, but only fields actually declared in the class (no inherited fields).\r\n\r\nWe already have logic to check for, and only store `public` fields, so we may be doing a bit more work going through a longer initial fields list, but the end result is the same. \r\nBut we're no longer trying to access and store fields from parent classes, which was causing an issue on Android version <= 26.\r\n\r\nIn terms of functionality, we are not losing anything because the `_get(...)` / `_set(...)` overrides do check the parent class if they can't find a field in the current class. With the previous logic, we were actually doing some wasted work since we were also checking for fields in the parent class, even though the current class already had all the fields.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5592930508/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5607913666","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123318#issuecomment-5607913666","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123318","id":5607913666,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTkH4wg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T19:59:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T19:59:25Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5607913666/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]